<section class="wrap sec" id="paths" aria-labelledby="paths-h">
  <header class="sec-head">
    <h2 id="paths-h">Which path is yours?</h2>
    <p>Four starting points, depending on where you're coming from. Each one has a short orientation on the Start page.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="paths">
    <a class="node path" href="{{ '/start/#evaluating' | url }}"><h3>Evaluating</h3><p>Decide if LID solves a problem you have. Skim, browse an example, read on.</p><span class="ptr" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
